CM_ BO_ 1911 "Requests to the EPS-resident SecOC signer. HEADER 0x80-0xB0 | sequence nibble: fragment 0-3 of a 28-byte CONTROL_REQUEST, 0x07: arm (DATA_1 0xC9A801) or release (0xC9A800) openpilot's CONTROL_REQUEST";
CM_ BO_ 1961 "Signer response with the SecOC trailer for the CONTROL_REQUEST with this SIGNER_SEQUENCE";
CM_ SG_ 1042 LANE_LINE_1 "1 = recognized, 2 = missing, 4 = recognized while active";
VAL_ 1042 LTA_MODE 20 "active" 18 "available" 16 "off" ;
VAL_ 1042 LTA_INDICATOR 2 "available" 1 "active" 0 "off" ;
